Zernio => Your frontend and backend handle your application, while Zernio handles the connection to social platforms.
Zernio provides a unified API so you don't have to build and maintain separate integrations for every platform.
Social media API for developers and AI agents.


CodeRabbit => CodeRabbit is used in a web-development project mainly for automated code review and finding bugs/issues in your code.
Think of it as an AI code reviewer that checks your code after you make changes, especially in GitHub pull requests. It can analyze the codebase and provide context-aware feedback and suggestions.


